1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:10,790 --> 00:01:11,710
I...

4
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,560
I really overdid it when I was young.

5
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,640
I wrecked my health.

6
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,040
The doctor said

7
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,870
I couldn't hope to have children.

8
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,680
So when he told me about it,

9
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,480
I got carried away.

10
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,710
I was just thinking

11
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,120
I'd finally give my father a grandson.

12
00:01:28,230 --> 00:01:30,280
That's why I took a paternity test.

13
00:01:30,510 --> 00:01:30,870
Mm.

14
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:32,230
I read the report.

15
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,840
The baby was definitely mine.

16
00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:36,480
I was so happy,
I gave them another 50,000 yuan.

17
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,510
I thought

18
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:40,480
I'd take better care of my own child.

19
00:01:40,510 --> 00:01:41,310
Right?

20
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,920
How did Xiao Ting die?

21
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,230
About Xiao Ting...

22
00:01:45,230 --> 00:01:46,280
I really don't know.

23
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,000
I really don't know.

24
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,310
Then tell us what you do know.

25
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:50,510
Well...

26
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:55,310
Officer, they were wary of me too.

27
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:56,870
They didn't tell me anything.

28
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,310
But I do know one thing.

29
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,070
They went

30
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,000
to Municipal Hospital

31
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,680
for treatment to preserve the pregnancy.

32
00:02:04,790 --> 00:02:05,680
I know that.

33
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:06,560
But

34
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,630
the baby was gone soon afterward.

35
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,680
They never told me what happened.

36
00:02:10,910 --> 00:02:11,750
They only said it was an accident.

37
00:02:12,470 --> 00:02:13,030
Tell me,

38
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:14,520
what could I have done?

39
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,870
Making a scene wouldn't help me.

40
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:19,870
So I just tried to get my money back.

41
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:20,910
As for the whole thing,

42
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:21,910
I let it go.

43
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,800
What happened later?

44
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,680
Later?

45
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,710
There was no later.

46
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,840
After that mess, I never went back.

47
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:32,280
You mentioned Brother Hao.

48
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,800
You mean Sun Jiahao?

49
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,360
Yes.

50
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,240
Sun Jiahao

51
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:37,150
was murdered.

52
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,120
Xu Haodong

53
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,240
was another one

54
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:39,910
who died because of this.

55
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:46,030
Wang Guosheng.

56
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,120
At this point,

57
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:49,680
tell us everything you know.

58
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,560
Talk.

59
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,750
Later...

60
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,120
Brother Hao...

61
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,280
Sun Jiahao...

62
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:02,910
Sun Jiahao came to me once.

63
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,120
He had set up some kind of

64
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:06,680
surrogacy agency.

65
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,520
I visited it.
It looked legitimate.

66
00:03:09,630 --> 00:03:11,080
No legitimate surrogacy agency exists.

67
00:03:11,470 --> 00:03:12,910
It's explicitly prohibited.
Didn't you know?

68
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:16,310
I truly didn't know, Officer.

69
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:17,870
All right.

70
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,470
You can punish me for that.
No problem.

71
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,120
But their deaths
had nothing to do with me.

72
00:03:24,910 --> 00:03:26,080
I truly had nothing to do with them.

73
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,680
Fine.
Let me show you someone.

74
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:33,630
Have you seen this person?

75
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:35,840
Take a closer look.

76
00:03:37,470 --> 00:03:37,910
I don't know her.

77
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,120
Definitely not.

78
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,280
This one...

79
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,520
May I take a closer look?

80
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,470
I've seen this person.

81
00:03:57,870 --> 00:03:58,520
I have.

82
00:03:59,400 --> 00:03:59,960
Wait.

83
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:04,910
I remember now.

84
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,470
At the time, they had...

85
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:10,680
Xiao...

86
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,430
Xiao Ting.

87
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,030
Right.
Xiao Ting.

88
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,360
At the time,

89
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,030
they had her locked in a room.

90
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,270
A group of people guarded her.

91
00:04:17,270 --> 00:04:18,040
One of them...
Right.

92
00:04:18,270 --> 00:04:18,680
It was her.

93
00:04:20,270 --> 00:04:21,240
Think carefully before you answer.

94
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,190
Are you sure?

95
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,190
I'm sure.

96
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:23,870
She...

97
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:24,920
After all,

98
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:26,680
she was quite pretty.

99
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,750
More importantly, she rarely spoke,

100
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:30,390
so she left a deep impression on me.

101
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,430
It was her.
I'm certain.

102
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:34,480
She was working with Sun Jiahao.

103
00:04:35,270 --> 00:04:36,000
If you're looking for this person,

104
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:37,510
investigate her.

105
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,270
You'll definitely...

106
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,630
Wang Guosheng, think carefully.

107
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,480
There she is!

108
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:47,950
She's doing it again.

109
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,720
She must be one of them!

110
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:51,120
Han Ning!

111
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,070
Han Ning!

112
00:04:57,270 --> 00:04:57,630
Captain Ren.

113
00:04:58,430 --> 00:04:58,800
I'm sorry.

114
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,390
Stay out of the next interrogation.

115
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:04,680
Take some time to reflect.

116
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,430
Captain Ren.

117
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,800
Have you considered this?

118
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,920
How could Sun Jiahao,
who never earned a high school diploma,

119
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:14,720
build such a complete surrogacy network?

120
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:16,510
Someone must have been helping him.

121
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:18,070
Whoever helped him is the killer.

122
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:19,480
It's just like my sister's case.

123
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,800
So you thought
you could disrupt the interrogation?

124
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,430
He's still young.

125
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,310
Being young is no excuse
for doing wrong.

126
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:49,040
You keep protecting him.

127
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:50,560
How can he ever grow?

128
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:12,120
Sun Jiahao's deal
with Wang Guosheng may have failed,

129
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,750
but it could have revealed
a new business opportunity.

130
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:17,430
That may have inspired investment
in the surrogacy operation.

131
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,240
Looking at the timeline,

132
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,360
that's very likely.

133
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:24,750
But Sun Jiahao was a local upstart
with only a middle school education.

134
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,310
He could hardly build
such a professional network alone.

135
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,160
Han Ning raised that point too.

136
00:06:32,390 --> 00:06:33,510
Judging by the scene,

137
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,120
Sun Jiahao's death is suspicious.

138
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:37,120
Besides Ding Wei,
there was likely a third person.

139
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:40,040
That's the real killer we need to find.

140
00:06:40,390 --> 00:06:42,750
We have few leads left to pursue.

141
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:45,120
Most medical staff at Luoda Biotech

142
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,310
had uncomplicated backgrounds.

143
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:47,270
They were ordinary employees.

144
00:06:48,830 --> 00:06:50,160
In his statement, Wang Guosheng

145
00:06:50,750 --> 00:06:51,720
mentioned one person:

146
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,190
Han Shuang.

147
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,480
Have something to eat.

148
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:47,800
You have to stay alive.

149
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,190
Don't give up on yourself.

150
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:55,870
Think about it.

151
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:58,720
Your family is still waiting
for you to come home.

152
00:08:03,070 --> 00:08:03,870
Who are you?

153
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:07,040
I'm Han Shuang.

154
00:08:08,310 --> 00:08:08,830
Eat.

155
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:34,200
Uncle He.

156
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,550
My sister disappeared seven years ago.

157
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,120
I don't even know

158
00:08:42,270 --> 00:08:43,550
whether the charred remains
include her.

159
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,510
Based on one accusation
from Wang Guosheng,

160
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,200
you suspect your sister

161
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:51,320
committed a crime too?

162
00:08:53,270 --> 00:08:53,600
Yes.

163
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:54,720
She's been missing so long.

164
00:08:55,270 --> 00:08:56,000
I don't know

165
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:56,870
where to start.

166
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:02,120
Start from the beginning.

167
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,510
On the evening of September 27,

168
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:15,910
police received a report at 6:00 p.m.

169
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,390
At Nanjiao Park,

170
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:21,150
a middle-aged man
abducted a young woman

171
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,550
and forced her into a black sedan.

172
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,630
He drove along Cuiping Mountain Road

173
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,320
toward the border.

174
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,600
We followed the road all the way here

175
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,270
and learned that Chen Wenji

176
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,790
had already entered the mountain.

177
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:45,080
Think about it.

178
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,510
If an accomplice killed Sun Jiahao

179
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:49,790
to silence him, then factor in

180
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,390
the killer's ruthlessness and skill
at hiding...

181
00:10:55,790 --> 00:10:57,240
You think Chen Wenji is still alive?

182
00:10:58,270 --> 00:10:58,510
Yes.

183
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:01,360
Because I never found his body.

184
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:05,120
But Chen Wenji was just a hitman.

185
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,630
He lacked the ability
to help Sun Jiahao.

186
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:11,080
Your sister's case is important,

187
00:11:12,030 --> 00:11:13,080
but look at her daily life.

188
00:11:14,030 --> 00:11:15,670
All she did was care for you and work.

189
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,440
Then why was she near Xiao Ting?

190
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,270
Could she have learned something

191
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,390
and been killed to silence her?

192
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:27,630
It's true.
My sister only cared for me and worked.

193
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:29,390
She had no reason to know
anyone connected to Sun Jiahao.

194
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,600
Unless...

195
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:15,690
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

196
00:12:15,690 --> 00:12:17,630
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

197
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:19,540
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

198
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:21,350
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

199
00:12:21,350 --> 00:12:23,690
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

200
00:12:23,690 --> 00:12:26,110
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

201
00:12:29,260 --> 00:12:31,160
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

202
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:33,060
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

203
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:35,000
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

204
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,130
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

205
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:39,140
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

206
00:12:39,140 --> 00:12:41,300
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

207
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:48,370
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

208
00:12:48,370 --> 00:12:51,740
♪Why is that child crying?♪

209
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:54,440
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

210
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,060
♪Means I've grown up♪

211
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:59,210
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

212
00:12:59,210 --> 00:13:02,700
♪The wound still aches♪

213
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:07,460
♪Like a biting winter♪

214
00:13:07,460 --> 00:13:10,720
♪But a spark still glows♪

